---
description: >-
  C4Context with `direction RL` at the top level: LR with the lines in the opposite order, so the first statement comes last. Six systems and a
  boundary of two, three to a line; the boundary is a child boundary, so it
  sits where the child boundaries go for this direction. Companion to the
  other direction fixtures of the same diagram.
---
C4Context
title Fill order RL
direction RL
System(a, "A")
System(b, "B")
System(c, "C")
System(d, "D")
System(e, "E")
System(f, "F")
Boundary(g, "Boundary") {
  System(h, "H")
  System(i, "I")
}
Rel(a, d, "Uses")
Rel(c, h, "Calls")
UpdateLayoutConfig($c4ShapeInRow="3", $c4BoundaryInRow="1")
